.notice { padding: 9px 11px; background: color-mix(in srgb, CanvasText 8%, Canvas); border-radius: 6px; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;body&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Reorder bookmarks and folders, and update saved workspaces&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drag bookmark folders and bookmarks into the order you want, and overwrite a saved workspace with the tabs you have open.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reorder bookmarks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Drag a folder heading or a bookmark above or below another. The order is kept after a restart and in every window.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update a workspace&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Use Update with Open Tabs… on a saved workspace to replace it with the tabs open in this window.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class="notice"&gt;Close active sessions before updating. Requires macOS 13 or later on Apple Silicon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/PROMLEE/promeftp/releases/tag/v1.1.16"&gt;Read the full release notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
